  "title": "osf work-tracker CLI: read Ready item, report state + recap",
  "summary": "Adds a `work-tracker` command group to the `osf` binary. `ready` builds a GitHub-backed tracker from a new `[work_tracker]` table in `osf.toml` and prints the single Ready work item (JSON or text); `report` parses a state (and a cause for `blocked`), reads a recap file, and writes state then recap through the same adapter. Supporting pieces are a new `WorkTrackerConfig` reader in `config.rs` (with the table stripped from the layered config merge), a thin `work_tracker_command` module wrapping the existing `work_tracker` ready/report logic, integration tests for the CLI contract, and a docs section.",
